<tr id="S4.T2.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T2.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" colspan="10">
<span id="S4.T2.2.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.2.1.8.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.2.1.8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">*Net change for the Quality Filter arm is calculated from its distinct performance after the initial generation and filtering step, which was 0.1638. Net change for control arms is from the shared Gen 0 base model.</span></span>
